.i melbi frili 
.i .e'u ko troci tau la .telegram. 
.i ku'i zabna ji'a fa lo nu cabna voksnu
.i mi'e la stela selckiku 
mu'o

i suppose i should say something for the english speakers too, hi, i'm 
available to voice chat, i got discord to work on my phone, or i think i 
have skype somewhere, or but the voice messages on telegram are VERY easy 
so maybe you'd like to try that too?? it'd be great if more of you would 
post voice messages on telegram, the bots are even set up to distribute 
them to all the connected channels, and voice messages are good for if 
there's a variety of skill levels because people can replay them if they 
didn't understand the first time

<3, 
mungojelly

